Changes:
- New chunk based memory handling
- Blocks are now 64x64 pixels in size
- Replaced all textures (besides the slime sprites)
- Plenty of code refactoring and new functions
- Fixed a horrible memory leak bug that was permanent (up to 10 gb of frozen ram, ouch)

